This item describes the tools available to managers in the process management area and describes how they integrate with your other apps for processes including workflows, portals, databases and BPMN.
Process managers play a key role in every organisation. They need to be highly skilled in IT tools to enable the right business processes on the right systems without affecting the other activities going on in the organisation:
Process automation: use tools such as flow charts to map out flows of tasks on specific organisational systems;
Process documentation: use tools to create step-by-step documents about how standard or customisation processes are deployed;
Process validation: use BPMN tools (Business Process Management notaries) to validate your standard processes by checking the logical interrelationship between messages;
Process measurement and control : Use apps for measuring outcomes achieved in each process in real-time through visualisation tools like bar-charts.
